Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indirao
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had to find the last Destiny\NStone before Black War Greymon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but troops travel better on a full\Nstomach, so we went for Chinese food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you believe the restaurant\Nbelonged to Digitamamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And having the house special\Nwere Arukenymon and Mamemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, we couldn't Digivolve,\Nbut neither could they, and they split.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two noodle brains were still hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they drank from\NDigitamamon's secret soup pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And inside wasn't a wonton,\Nbut the last Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody and I were finally\Nable to DNA Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:02:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just in time, too, because Shakuromon is\Nour last chance against Blackwort Braymon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.68,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fscx100\fscy100\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(316,329)}The Gigantic Ultimate, Qinglongmon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it all you've got. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kachinobahn is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coolest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing out since clumping glitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His enemies better make\Ntravel plans because
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his Kachina Bombs will send them flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.16,0:02:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.22,0:02:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we don't have to make Paildramon\Nand Silphymon do all the hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him have it, Shakkoumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll prove my mettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're standing between me\Nand the last Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna make us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move or else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We choose else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still too strong for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monette!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gekomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He swallowed up Blackwar\NGreymon's Terra Force! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harmonious spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, guys! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a plan, I yield your mind! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, protect the Destiny Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Static Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asked for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you persist this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hachinaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep trying to\Nprotect the Destiny Stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little something\Nwe call saving the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so certain that\Nwhat you fight for is right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Wars!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we did it! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel tired of this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over, we win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep asking questions of my enemies,\Nand yet I still get no answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I so different from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why was I created like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if they won't answer me, then why\Nshould I be concerned about them anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have given every opponent the\Nchance to convince me otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now I am through talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I care if they are destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or for that matter, their\Nwhole precious digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he needs is a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroying the Destiny Stone\Nmeans my own destruction as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if that's what it takes to\Nfinally find my answer, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take another step or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I choose or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's no use we can't stop\Nhim but if the destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stone is destroyed the whole\Ndigital world will be lost
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm afraid it won't only\Nbe the digi world but our
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world will be destroyed too\Ntime for plan b by the way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does anybody know what\Nplan b is we can try moving
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stone good idea let's do\Nit while the dna digivolve
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digimon are still able to\Nhold off black war Koromon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we lift that? You'll\Nnever know unless we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better than doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.62,0:06:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, no one has any better ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a better idea. Say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're ready to shut\Nup, forget her, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get me\Nupset, but it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mummymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to put these kids\Nunder wraps for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nightmare Syndrome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you not to drink out\Nof the Chinese soup spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of your destiny stone, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Digitammon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tapermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we move that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try using the old D3s.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.54,0:07:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are all those lights doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're combining into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what I need, another flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those kids doing back\Nthere with the Destiny Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope they don't eat all the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the same Digimon\Nwe saw when Blackboard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymon destroyed the other Destiny Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's almost as big as my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better know how to fight, because\NBlackboard Raymon's been looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, my ultimate\Nopponent has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the one with the\Naccursed soul of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soul of darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't mean me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why do you\Ndestroy the Destiny Stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it to make you\Nappear so we can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are stronger than any\NDigimon I've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:09:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only that you are my ultimate opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Qinglongmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Zoolongmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the guardian of the eastern\Nhemisphere of the digital
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world and the keeper of the\Nspheres of light and hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you have destroyed the Destiny\NStones, this world has become unbalanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand the consequences\Nof what you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about any of that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight me, Azulongmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that's the reason\Nyou caused all this suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it is your existence\Nitself that seals my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power and causes the unbalance in this\Nworld. My existence? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't handle the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The control spires here in the eastern\Nregion were built to seal my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.64,0:09:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you are made from a\Nhundred of those spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The control spire seal is power!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was the one that built them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, so now you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Arukenemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our plan was a simple one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Build as many control spires\Nas possible and destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the balance of the digital\Nworld once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a problem, so sue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the reason you chose me\Nto be the Digimon Emperor, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you knew I would build\Nthose control spires for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win the booby prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.93,0:10:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just as construction was\Ngoing along swimmingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you decided to join forces\Nwith the other Digidodos
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and start destroying all\Nmy precious control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I created you to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but instead you wander around the digital\Nworld like a baby looking for its bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't it ever occur to you that Digimon\Nlike yourself have no souls of their own?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a brand new outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard it is to\Nget wrinkles out of polyester?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get mad at me because\Nfate has dealt you a bad hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why am I standing here\Nwithin an inch of destroying you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that fate too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:10:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blackwar Graymarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you ask more questions than Cody does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can answer it but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, every life has\Na purpose, a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The circumstances surrounding\Nits birth don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that my\Nlife has a meaning too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, it is up to you to find\Nout what that meaning is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black War, Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing more to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to hear a good joke,\NGennai told me while I was in Limbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Archnemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful to have met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now know that my existence has meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if that meaning is only\Nto be hated and loathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someplace where things go to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try my sock drawer.\NDisappear, Mummymon! Let's go! Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stop him you fool oh right oh don't\Ngo anywhere i'll be back to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you in a minute ditto that destiny\Nstones can break my bones but
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you guys are real losers oh that's\Nclever did you write it yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now for you digi destiny i\Nam one of the four mega digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who preserve the balance of\Nthe digital world i protect the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eastern region hey that sounds\Nlike kyoto kyoto how remember
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i told you about it i learned\Nit from sora's dad the city is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protected by spirits in the\Neast west south and north that's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,correct there are many similarities\Nbetween your world and ours
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after a long battle we guardians\Nwere sealed away by each of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dark masters they didn't\Neven leave us something to read
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was then that seven of the\Neight digi destiny came to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the digital world and once the\Nseven had returned to their
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own world, the Dark Masters\Ndismantled it and reshaped it to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fit their own knees spiral\Nmountain the eight children and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their digimon were able to\Ndefeat the dark masters but we
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were still trapped beneath the\Nseal in order to break the seal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we needed to take away the power\Nfrom the digi destined crest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of course joe complained about\Nit but he complained about
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it meant that the Digimon could no longer\Ndigivolve to their ultimate levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:13:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why our help is needed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the reason our Digimon could\Nonly digivolve during certain times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, DK, this must be what\NIzzy was talking about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, he must have\Nknown about Qinglongmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Izzy is quite intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, without that intelligence,\Nhe'd be, well, he'd be tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark powers, controls fires, kept\Nthe Digimon from being able to digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who wish for harmony\Nin the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,decided to use an ancient\Nform of digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must mean armored\Ndigivolving. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took several Digimon who\Nstill had the ancient powers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and prepared them for the\Narrival of the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, they were drafted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to combat the powers of darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they made three new Digivices and\Nsent them to the new Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.43,0:14:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now you're talking about me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world doesn't revolve around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's talking about all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something happened that\Nwas not anticipated. It
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems you had a device\Nthat was capable of storing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,several digi eggs at once\Nsort of like a digital egg
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.91,0:15:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carton i believe you call\Nit a d terminal so when the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digi eggs of sincerity\Nfriendship and reliability
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.19,0:15:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were needed they were given\Nto you also the crest of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kindness was hidden by the\Npowers of darkness so it was
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,necessary to rebuild it into\Nthe digi-egg of miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy, so we\Nhired a general contractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sounds so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend, I feel your agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that one day you will\Nfind the answer to your question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least now you can regain\Nyour power, right, Aquilamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, not right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.49,0:15:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world is too unbalanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must plant my seeds of light where the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destiny Stones once stood\Nand hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:15:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never had much of a green thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of seeds of light?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seeds that will sprout and take on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same purpose as the Destiny Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then the balance of the digital\Nworld will be restored little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.21,0:16:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.95,0:16:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why so quiet? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, if you've got something\Nto say, then just say it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that we might\Njust have to find and destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every single thing that has to\Ndo with the powers of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, they will continue\Nto grow bigger and bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And before you know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have a bunch more creatures\Nlike Black War Greymon roaming around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.01,0:16:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken understands the powers of\Ndarkness more than any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, he's the one that\Nfirst created Chimeramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that'll be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:17:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree that the powers of\Ndarkness are a terrible thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think I speak\Nfor all of us by saying
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be easier if they were destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just don't think that it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because where there's light, you'll always\Nfind darkness as well. T.K.'s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the stronger the light is,\Nthen the deeper the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we have to remember that no matter\Nhow the powers of darkness surround you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the most important thing is\Nnot to lose the light inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.55,0:17:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the light inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light inside is hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all around you is darkness, you\Nmust keep the light on inside your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.85,0:17:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how high your\Nelectric bill gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.85,0:17:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same as the Crest of Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light in your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the Dark Masters were defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those bearing the Crests of Light and\NHope were the ones that broke my seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK, those were our crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the Dark Digivice was\Nbrought into the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Harmonious Ones were\Nonly able to find three
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon who had the ancient power\Nof armor Digivolving. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.01,0:18:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Digimon belonging to the\NDigidestine with the Crests
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.01,0:18:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of Light and Hope also were\Ncapable of the same power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, their Digivices took on new forms,\Nallowing them to armor Digivolve as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon and Nefertimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These two Crests, Light and Hope,\Nare different from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Crest of Courage, the Crest of Love,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Crest of Knowledge come from the\Npower inside the Digidestin's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the Crest of Light\Ngives life to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.69,0:18:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Crest of Hope continues to shine\Nno matter how darkness tries to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once all the DigiDestined\Njoin their hearts together,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the power was born and the\Nlight shone even brighter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,giving the Digimon the\Nability to Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:19:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is because of you, DigiDestined,\Nthat the digital world still exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though Black Wargreymon is gone, and\Nmy power will soon be restored, beware,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the threat is not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.93,0:19:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.37,0:19:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evil that tried to seal\Nme away has not disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about\NArchnemon and Mummymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they are merely pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is an even greater\Nhatred in existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean someone else is\Ncontrolling our Rukenny mod?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that's who was controlling me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job is not finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must not stop until the digital\Nworld is safe once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll keep one eye on the Digi\Nworld and one eye on our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll keep the\Nother eye on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, despite him, I wish you\Nall good luck in your quest. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.95,0:19:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.47,0:20:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I'm able to\Nreturn to my restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about some treats?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they're not much,\Nbut take them, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, free food!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.63,0:20:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was reaching for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all the same, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.09,0:20:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.23,0:20:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to try one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll try one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.93,0:20:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said that one's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Chinese buns were great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had one more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't know you were counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.13,0:20:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to food, I always count.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.03,0:20:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.47,0:21:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not exactly sure, but I\Nthink I just saw a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try wearing those\Ngoggles once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.63,0:21:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control spire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what Yoli says.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.13,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The car goes on the road to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the car is a straight-to-air.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.64,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to turn back on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.06,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to connect with the hands\Ntogether, and I'm going to drive together.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.57,0:22:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always say it's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.25,0:22:03.25,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can always say it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.17,0:22:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always say it's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.25,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.26,0:22:17.18,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.18,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
